<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθ-ιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speak in a high tone, speak loud,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. γόοις</span>
			<i>shriek with loud</i> wailings, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				687
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.60
			</span></i> W. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθόω</span>
			, <i>set upright,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.261.2
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθιάζοντα,</span>
			
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηνδρωμένον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.70
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
